    activity: "Read Acts 17:10-12 and Ephesians 4:11-16. Test invented claims using the questions in the lesson. Practise polite responses to relativism.",
    takeHome: "Read John 14 and 17, Acts 17, Ephesians 4 and 2 Timothy 3 and 4. Write a checklist for testing teaching. Memorise John 17:17.",
