    sa: ["How should believers approach festivals and customs?", ["scripture", "conscience", "idolatry", "love", "stumble", "peace"], "A good answer says believers sort questions by Scripture, flee idolatry, follow conscience, avoid causing stumbling and pursue peace and unity."],
